  "question": {
    "text": "When two dice are thrown <math><mi>n</mi></math> number of times, the probability of getting a doublet atleast once is greater than <math><mn>80</mn><mi>%</mi></math>&nbsp;and the least value of <math><mi>n</mi></math> is <math><mi>&#955;</mi></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
